<h2>PDF Reader &amp; Knowledge</h2>
<ul><li>Organize course PDFs and connected notes by chapter in a single folder.</li><li>Open chapter notes, jump to the original PDF page, or start a chapter review directly from the folder.</li><li>Expand the chapter you need while keeping the rest compact.</li></ul>
<h2>Updates, at your pace</h2>
<ul><li>Read what&#39;s changed before installing an update.</li><li>Skip this version or ask PRISM to remind you later.</li><li>Choose whether future updates can download and install automatically. This is off until you enable it.</li></ul>
<p>Your notes, PDF attachments, annotations, links, review progress, and settings stay in your workspace when PRISM updates.</p></body></html>]]></description>
